%SIXMD 1
# @?MOUNT - MOUNT A DEC@TAPE FILESYSTEM

## @?OPTIONS

### @?-O OPTIONS
COMMA-SEPARATED RO OR RW ACCESS AND OPTIONAL NATIVE, TENEX, OR ITS
PERSONALITY.  THE DEFAULT IS RO WITH AUTOMATIC PERSONALITY DETECTION.

## @?OPERANDS

### @?DEVICE
DECTAPE DEVICE TO MOUNT.

### @?TARGET
EXISTING DIRECTORY TO USE AS THE MOUNT POINT.

## DESCRIPTION

MOUNT IS THE SHORT ADMINISTRATIVE NAME FOR THE CURRENT DTFS MOUNT PATH.  IT
PROBES THE MEDIA PERSONALITY BEFORE REQUESTING THE VFS MOUNT.
USAGE IS 'MOUNT [-O OPTIONS] DEVICE TARGET'.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OPERATION FAILED OR CONDITION FALSE
### @?2 - INVALID USAGE WHEN APPLICABLE
